   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• Active-Passive Failover\n• Heartbeat + Timeout\n• Fencing (Epoch)\n• Retry + Idempotency + Deadline\n• Circuit Breaker\n• Bulkhead\n• Safety Interlock\n• Graceful Degradation\n• Store-and-Forward\n• Queue-Based Load Leveling\n• Load Shedding\n• Rate Limiting",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "• Active-Passive Failover\n• Heartbeat + Timeout\n• Fencing (Epoch)\n• Retry + Idempotency + Deadline\n• Circuit Breaker\n• Bulkhead\n• Safety Interlock\n• Graceful Degradation\n• Store-and-Forward\n• Queue-Based Load Leveling\n• Load Shedding\n• Rate Limiting",
