   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• 3 reactors × 100 sensors × 20 readings/s = 6,000 msg/s\n• Design capacity 3× = 18,000 msg/s\n• ≈ 518 M readings/day (≈ 17 GB/day raw, 32 B/reading)\n• Few users: ≤ 20 concurrent dashboards (hypothetical)\n• Audit: low volume, kept ≥ 10 years",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "• 3 reactors × 100 sensors × 20 readings/s = 6,000 msg/s\n• Design capacity 3× = 18,000 msg/s\n• ≈ 518 M readings/day (≈ 17 GB/day raw, 32 B/reading)\n• Few users: ≤ 20 concurrent dashboards (hypothetical)\n• Audit: low volume, kept ≥ 10 years",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
